    "body": "References #2030, #2031. Line: unified geometric route/action/learning integration. Count4/3 ->5/3 under explicit owner implementation; no reset/closure. Headline437/512 plus opened0/128 -> unchanged panel fitting. Named future unified-bound-content-437 NOT_RUN/not FIT-cleared.\n\nImplements #2231 CPU native source reference: actual packed compiler spans/views, staged exact memory, bounded Claude E8/SpiralCore route, native donor/action/Copy/Generate/EOS, one original-Var inventory and complete-answer pooled-ranking/terminal credit. Transactional rebinding, fractional masters, greedy reload, geometry-codebook identity and canonical-frame consumption stay bound beside exact content/version identity. Native profile coefficients use additions/shifts; ordinary bank behavior stays intact.\n\n15 tiny whole-path fixtures +7 adjacent compiler/store/frozen-guard +8 integer Context regressions passed. 7 native-bank regressions passed on unchanged earlier core and are being rebuilt at this head before queue. Final-head test/review receipts follow before queue; compatibility checks are not tests. No optimizer/training/corpus/panel/fresh draw/GPU job/rent. CUDA construction is explicitly rejected by this CPU source reference. Sampled checkpoint/optimizer, batch/device/data/FIT remain blocking. Owner training hold stays; no automatic third prep loop.\n\nCanonical record docs/labs/whole-path-implementation-2026-10-12/README.md and current-state/mechanism/design follow-up/README/STATUS/ROADMAP included. Newer Claude FBS/readout and DeepSeek entries preserved. Opposite outcome: source/credit/binding failure blocks the future run as repairable tooling; passing fixtures permits prospective gate/FIT review only, never model promotion.\n\nCost carries from1,627,752,185/1,650,772,756ms through02:45UTC, charging ALL nonoverlapping prep/build/failure/wait/review/storage/delivery, no reset/$0 new paid compute. Protected merge, fresh-main verification, custody, branch/worktree deletion and hygiene remain required before reporting delivery.",
